{"pr": 24134, "type": "features", "branch": "1.7.8.x", "title": "Remove combination from list", "url": "https://github.com/PrestaShop/PrestaShop/pull/24134", "issue": 24260, "issue_title": "[Experimental product page] Add missing 'Remove' feature for combinations listing", "issue_body": "<!--\r\n****************************\r\nDO NOT disclose security issues here, contact security@prestashop.com instead!\r\n****************************\r\n-->\r\n\r\n### Describe the bug\r\n\r\nThe QA team explored the experimental product page and reported that 'Remove' feature for combinations listing is missing.\r\n\r\nYou should be able to click on the remove icon. A confirm modal will ask you if you are sure, if you click on yes the combination is removed and the list is updated.\r\n\r\nIf you remove the default combination the first one in the list is the new one\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n#### Additional information\r\n\r\n* PrestaShop version: `1.7.8.x`\r\n", "base_commit": "2cf3b617b35bebea921df3fc9f43e693bcbd9796", "merge_commit": "a8b9ea52edaa7f145a6d2f9bc998dea11d9fc729", "files": ["admin-dev/themes/new-theme/js/fos_js_routes.json", "admin-dev/themes/new-theme/js/pages/product/edit/combinations-manager.js", "admin-dev/themes/new-theme/js/pages/product/edit/feature-values-manager.js", "admin-dev/themes/new-theme/js/pages/product/product-map.js", "admin-dev/themes/new-theme/js/pages/product/services/combinations-service.js", "src/Adapter/Product/Combination/CommandHandler/RemoveCombinationCommandHandler.php", "src/Adapter/Product/Combination/Update/CombinationRemover.php", "src/Adapter/Product/Combination/Update/DefaultCombinationUpdater.php", "src/Core/Domain/Product/Combination/Command/RemoveCombinationCommand.php", "src/Core/Domain/Product/Combination/CommandHandler/RemoveCombinationCommandHandlerInterface.php", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Controller/Admin/Sell/Catalog/Product/CombinationController.php", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Form/Admin/Sell/Product/Combination/CombinationItemType.php", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Form/Admin/Sell/Product/FeatureValueType.php", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Resources/config/routing/admin/sell/catalog/product_v2/combination.yml", "src/PrestaShopBundle/Resources/config/services/adapter/product/_combination.yml", "tests/Integration/Behaviour/Features/Context/Domain/Product/Combination/GenerateCombinationFeatureContext.php", "tests/Integration/Behaviour/Features/Scenario/Product/Combination/remove_combination.feature"], "lines": 407, "labels": ["QA ✔️", "Feature", "migration", "Wording ✔️", "1.7.8.x"]}
